A coaligned altar in minetown is a great stash place.  Because of the altar
and the fountains it can be your alchemy lab and give you 586 hitpoints...
It's works well to use a sack instead of a large box if you need to.

Also if you find a small room with intact doors you can make an "office" and
keep lots of nifty stuff there, including the bell of opening.  Make sure to
lock the doors.  I once had dug a little rathole behind a coaligned temple
and the was my center of operations.  I blocked it off with a boulder and
some notches.  You have to make sure dwarves and rock moles don't dig in to
your office.  If they do, use ?earth to block their tunnels.

Definitely don't be burdened while exploring new levels.  If you're just
hauling junk down to a polypile through conquered territory its okay.  And
blessed bags of holding are REALLY nice.




